---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Thank you, we have received your details" description="Your candidate profile or enquiry has been received by Ukraine Medical Admissions. Nothing has been sent to any university." noindex={true}>
  <div class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Received</span><h1>Thank you, we have your details</h1><p>Your candidate profile or enquiry has reached Ukraine Medical Admissions. We will reply by email.</p></div></div>
  <section><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What this means</h2>
    <p>Your details have been received by Ukraine Medical Admissions only. They have <strong>not</strong> been sent to any university, and no application has been made on your behalf. No documents were uploaded.</p>
    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>We read what you sent us.</li>
      <li>We reply by email with answers to your questions and the next steps we suggest. Where a university's requirements have not yet been verified from its official pages, we say so plainly.</li>
      <li>An application goes to a university only after you confirm it, and only through the university's own procedure.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Please do not email scans of your passport or certificates. We will ask for documents only through a secure application dashboard, once one is available.</p>
    <p>While you wait, you can read <a href="/admissions/#official-sites">how to check a university's official website</a> and <a href="/tuition-fees/#reading-a-fee-schedule">how to read a fee schedule</a>, or see the <a href="/universities/">universities we are researching</a>.</p>
    <p>If you did not send this, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
